Google Cloud Is Growing Fast
​Google Cloud is becoming more successful.
​More companies are using its cloud services.
​Many businesses also use Google Cloud for AI work.
​The company has added new tools and data centers.
​This helps customers build and run AI applications.
​Google Cloud competes with Amazon Web Services (AWS) and Microsoft Azure.
​The competition is strong.
​But Google Cloud continues to grow.
​The writer says the company is doing well because many businesses want cloud services and AI tools.
​Google plans to keep improving its technology.
​It hopes more customers will choose its cloud platform in the future.
